      en: ["The highest point of the massif is at 2,320 meters.", "The ring complex has a diameter of about 35 kilometers.", "The rare Erongo sun gazelle was discovered here.", "Cave paintings found here date back over 2,000 years.", "The mountains are famous for the occurrence of aquamarine.", "The range is located northwest of the town of Omaruru."],
